How to run the frontend project in terminal

# Terminal 1
npm run dev

# Terminal 2
npm run worker:dev

# stripe CLI run 
1. open the terminal in c>stripe
2. run the command
    ./stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhooks/stripe



